OL,3,GNEWSACare home row over 'eyesore'
OL,4,Adebris in gardens
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living near a former care
OL,7,Fhome say their gardens have been filled
OL,8,Fby rubbish which has blown on to their
OL,9,Fproperties after being left outside.
OL,11,FPeople living near Fitzroy Lodge in
OL,12,FWindsor Road, Worthing, say items left
OL,13,Foutside the building are "disgusting"
OL,14,Fand "an eyesore" and have been being
OL,15,Fblown on to their property since
OL,16,Fappearing last week.
OL,18,FThe owner of the building told BBC
OL,19,FRadio Sussex the items were being
OL,20,Fremoved ahead of a sale of the site,
OL,21,Fand he hoped to have the debris cleared
OL,22,Fby the end of this week.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
