OL,3,GNEWSACare home row over 'eyesore'
OL,4,Adebris in gardens
OL,5,
OL,6,FCraig Smith, a neighbour who lives next
OL,7,Fdoor to the site, said: "It has been an
OL,8,Fabsolute nightmare for residents."
